The five datasets in this directory — `symmetry_basics.json.gz`,
`spacegroup_setting_transforms.json.gz`, `baernighausen_std.json.gz`,
`continuous_euclidean_normalizer_std.json.gz`, and
`affine_normalizer_cosets.json.gz` — are licensed under the

