Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

The license permits attribution to be given "in any reasonable manner based on the
medium, means, and context", including by providing a URI or hyperlink to the license;
the links above serve that purpose, and the required attribution follows.


ATTRIBUTION
-----------

Title:      Crystallographic symmetry datasets generated by httk data-generators
Creator:    Rickard Armiento
Source:     httk data-generators — https://github.com/httk/data-generator
Version:    0.1.0
License:    CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

These are byte-for-byte `.json.gz` artifacts of the canonical upstream JSON-LD
publications. Each dataset carries its detailed attribution and provenance in its own
JSON-LD header; see README.md for the dataset list and refresh instructions.

The upstream `.sqlar` twins remain available for large-dataset/lazy-access use. The data
were generated with the aid of cctbx (https://cctbx.github.io/) and spglib
(https://spglib.readthedocs.io/), which carry their own separate license terms.


